     The ccbbrrtt(), ccbbrrttff(), and ccbbrrttll() functions return the requested cube
     root.  The ssqqrrtt(), ssqqrrttff(), and ssqqrrttll() functions return the requested
     square root unless an error occurs.  An attempt to take the ssqqrrtt() of
     negative _x raises an invalid exception and causes an _N_a_N to be returned
     (except that the square root of -0 is valid and equal to -0.)

